    Plugin IDs      : N/A
    STIG-ID         : WN11-AC-000040
    Documentation   : https://stigaview.com/products/win11/v2r8/WN11-AC-000040/

.TESTED ON
    Date(s) Tested  : 
    Tested By       : 
    Systems Tested  : 
    PowerShell Ver. : 

.USAGE
    Put any usage instructions here.
    Example syntax:
    PS C:\> .\STIG-ID-WN11-AC-000040.ps1 
